    "created_at": "2016-03-18T00:14:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-18T00:14:40Z",
    "body": "Right. So just move where we grab it for now, and maybe change it to \"current\" later?\n\nOh, and a potential third realm shows up in step 2: \"Let targetRealm be this Window object's JavaScript realm.\" What a fun method.\n\n(For future reference: we're talking about window.postMessage here, not worker or MessagePort or BroadcastChannel. After some examination, none of those seem to show similar problems, although some of them are indeed a mess of different settings objects.)\n",
